---
title: rtc_button_handler
---

flowchart TD
    A[RTC screen event arrives] --> B[Read pressed control and current UI state]
    B --> C{Mode button pressed?}
    C -- Yes --> D{Editing or display toggle?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Enter or leave edit mode]
    E --> F[Save time when needed]
    F --> G[Update mode label]

    C -- No --> H{Editing mode active?}
    H -- No --> I[Ignore non-mode controls]
    I --> J[return]
    H -- Yes --> K[Handle next/add/minus actions]
    K --> L[Update edit state]
    L --> M[Refresh mode label]
    G --> J
    M --> J
